     "name": "timeline",
     "note": "Timeline — durations on a shared axis. Every row is measured from the same",
     "body": "# Timeline — durations on a shared axis. Every row is measured from the same\n# zero, or the chart is a lie told with alignment.\n\n## a build, by stage\n 0s                    4s                    8s                   12s\n ├─────────────────────┼─────────────────────┼─────────────────────┤\n resolve   ▰▰                                                  0.6s\n compile     ▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰                                6.1s\n link                           ▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰                     3.4s\n test                                     ▰▰▰▰▰                 1.5s\n sign                                          ▰                0.3s\n                                                          total 11.9s\n\n## a request, waterfall — where the time actually went\n dns        ▰                                     12 ms\n connect     ▰▰                                   28 ms\n tls           ▰▰▰▰                               61 ms\n ttfb              ▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰        312 ms  ⚠\n download                                  ▰▰▰    41 ms\n ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n total                                            454 ms\n ↑ one segment carries the cost; it is the only one that earns a colour\n\n## events on a line — no duration, only when\n 09:00        12:00        15:00        18:00\n ├────────────┼────────────┼────────────┤\n      ◆            ✗   ◆         ◆\n      deploy       fail  rollback  deploy\n ↑ the mark sits under its own label, or the reader has to count columns\n\n## overlapping work — lanes, because a row can hold only one thing\n worker-1  ▰▰▰▰▰▰      ▰▰▰▰        ▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰\n worker-2     ▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰     ▰▰▰▰▰\n worker-3  ▰▰▰      ▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰▰\n ↑ idle is empty space, never a track: a filled track says \"busy at low level\",\n   which is a different fact\n\n# paint: bars -> kin-1 · the critical path or the slowest stage -> kaki-1\n# a failed stage -> aka-0 · axis, ticks and rules -> line-0 · totals in bone"
